1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,700
Why did the policeman ask the writer to come to the police station?
警察为什么要作者去警察局？

2
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:18,430
Why did the policeman ask the writer to come to the police station?
警察为什么要作者去警察局？

3
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:25,150
It must have been about two in the morning when I returned home.
我回到家时大概是凌晨两点钟。

4
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:29,580
I tried to wake up my wife by ringing the doorbell,
我想按门铃叫醒妻子，

5
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,800
but she was fast asleep,
但她睡得很沉，

6
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:38,000
so I got a ladder from the shed in the garden, put it against the wall,
于是我从花园的小棚里搬来一架梯子，靠在墙上，

7
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:41,850
and began climbing towards the bedroom window.
开始朝卧室的窗户爬去。

8
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:48,550
I was almost there when a sarcastic voice below said.
我快要爬到时，下面一个讽刺的声音说道。

9
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:54,510
'I don't think the windows need cleaning at this time of the night.'
“我看这深更半夜的，窗户不需要擦吧。”

10
00:00:56,060 --> 00:01:00,970
I looked down and nearly fell off the ladder when I saw a policeman.
我低头一看，发现是警察，差点从梯子上摔下来。

11
00:01:01,810 --> 00:01:11,170
I immediately regretted answering in the way I did, but I said,'I enjoy cleaning windows at night.'
我立刻后悔这样回答，但我已经说了：“我喜欢在夜里擦窗户。”

12
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:17,050
'So do I,' answered the policeman in the same tone.
“我也喜欢，”警察用同样的语调回答说。

13
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:20,350
Excuse my interrupting you.
请原谅我打断您。

14
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:29,230
I hate to interrupt a man when he's busy working, but would you mind coming with me to the station?'
我不愿意打断一个忙着干活的人，不过请您跟我到警察局去一趟好吗？”

15
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:35,370
'Well, I'd prefer to stay here,' I said.
“嗯，我宁愿待在这儿，”我说。

16
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:39,940
'You see, I've forgotten my key.'
“您瞧，我忘了带钥匙。”

17
00:01:40,270 --> 00:01:43,120
'Your what?' he called.
“您的什么？”他喊道。

18
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:47,830
'My key,' I shouted.
“我的钥匙，”我大声说。

19
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:57,790
Fortunately, the shouting woke up my wife who opened the window just as the policeman had started to climb towards me.
幸好这喊声吵醒了妻子，就在警察开始朝我爬上来时，她打开了窗户。
